msgstr "No correction. The colour you choose is sent to the strip exactly as it is."

msgid "Keeps every LED on the 48 safe colors that cheap LED strips show cleanly."
msgstr "Keeps every lamp upon the 48 respectable colours that modest strips display cleanly."

msgid ""
"Corrects colors so they look right on your strip. Choose the profile that matches it (edit them "
"in Settings)."
msgstr ""
"Corrects colours so they look proper upon your strip. Choose the profile befitting it (amend them"
" in Preferences)."

msgid "Zones use different corrections. Pick one to set them all."
msgstr "The zones differ in their corrections. Choose one to settle them all."

